WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.847
Week 18: Irregular Preterite and Meaning Change. report discoveries and attempts distinguish intention from outcome summarize a trip

2
00:00:08.847 --> 00:00:29.612
Read for the situation. El equipo quiso cruzar el puente, pero no pudo. Fue por otra ruta y allí supo que una tormenta dañó la carretera. Finalmente tuvo que regresar. The team wanted to cross the bridge but could not. It took another route and learned there that a storm had damaged the road. In the end, it had to return.

3
00:00:29.612 --> 00:00:38.182
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:38.182 --> 00:00:45.152
Reading activities. Reading activity 42; Reading activity 43; Reading activity 44

5
00:00:45.152 --> 00:00:52.933
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:52.933 --> 00:01:18.444
Model language. El equipo quiso cruzar el puente. — The team wanted to cross the bridge. No pudo cruzar por la tormenta. — It couldn't cross because of the storm. Fue por otra carretera. — It went by another road. Allí supo que la tormenta dañó el camino. — There it found out the storm had damaged the road. Finalmente tuvo que regresar. — In the end it had to return.

7
00:01:18.444 --> 00:01:28.193
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
